        "id": "bp-a83883b3-a239-4c66-a5c9-7c781b22ba36",
        "name": "Wreckage Cinematic",
        "description": "On enter: shake → ping → physics impulse on the toucher → set environment → banner → Objective + 1 → delay → hide + restore env.",
